# 유저 데이터는 뭐가 있지?

- user_exercise_metadata
```sql
select * from user_exercise_metadata
  order by user_id desc
  limit 15;
```

## SURVEY
- user_urvey
```sql
select * from user_survey
  order by id desc
  limit 15;
```

```sql
select * from survey_v2
  order by id desc
  limit 15;
```
@ManyToOne(() => SurveyKeyEntity, (surveyKey) => surveyKey.surveyV2)
  @JoinColumn({ name: 'survey_key_id' })
  surveyKey: SurveyKeyEntity

  @OneToMany(() => SurveyQuestionEntity, (q) => q.survey)
  surveyQuestion: SurveyQuestionEntity[]

  @OneToMany(() => UserSurveySubmitEntity, (s) => s.survey)
  userSurveySubmit: UserSurveySubmitEntity[]

  @OneToMany(() => TrainerSurveySubmitEntity, (s) => s.survey)
  trainerSurveySubmit: TrainerSurveySubmitEntity[]

  @OneToMany(() => UserSurveySubmitAnswerEntity, (a) => a.survey)
  userSurveySubmitAnswer: UserSurveySubmitAnswerEntity[]

  @OneToMany(() => TrainerSurveySubmitAnswerEntity, (a) => a.survey)
  trainerSurveySubmitAnswer: TrainerSurveySubmitAnswerEntity[]

- survey question
```sql
select * from survey_question
  order by id desc
  limit 15;
```

- survey full data  
```sql
select s.id, s.survey_key_id  -- s.name
  , sq.id, sq.title, sq.description, sq.child_question_id 
  from survey_v2 s
  join survey_question sq on s.id = sq.survey_id
  -- join user_survey_submit on survey_v2.id = user_survey_submit.survey_id
  -- join user_survey_submit_answer on user_survey_submit.id = user_survey_submit_answer.user_survey_submit_id
  -- join trainer_survey_submit on survey_v2.id = trainer_survey_submit.survey_id
  -- join trainer_survey_submit_answer on trainer_survey_submit.id = trainer_survey_submit_answer.trainer_survey_submit_id
  where s.id = 1;
  order by s.id desc
  limit 15;
```

